<title>SWITZERLAND: Zuercher Kantonalbank posts steady 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Zuercher Kantonalbank posts steady 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996 vs 1995</p>
<p>				   (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     147.3	     vs 147.0</p>
<p> Gross profit		   485.9	     vs 409.7</p>
<p>Total value adjustments,</p>
<p> provisions, losses	   194.4	     vs 249.5</p>
<p> Interest income		747.4	     vs 676.6</p>
<p> Commission income	    202.6	     vs 185.9</p>
<p> Trading income		 83.5		vs 81.1</p>
<p> Balance sheet total	  56,710	    vs 56,033</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Zuercher Kantonalbank, owned by the Canton of Zurich. The bank's mangement told a news conference that there were no plans for a privatisation. The bank passed on 124.7 million francs to the canton for a return of 6.5 percent on the capital provided by the canton.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom 41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
